    "created_at": "2015-12-01T02:33:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-12-01T02:33:40Z",
    "body": "Tables need to also reset the inherited text-align if it came from an align attribute, right?  That is, they need to not only stop messing with the margins of their child blocks (the \"align descendants\" bit) but also not move text around inside those blocks.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
