    "created_at": "2018-01-30T00:23:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-01-30T00:23:54Z",
    "body": "I guess technically the preshint layer isn't a UA style, but injecting `justify-content` at that level would be just fine, and probably more in line with the intention of the cascade. :)",
